Dist info:
- happy (~60%): Massively overused - dominates both reaction and self phases
- cool (~20%): Frequently used as neutral fallback
- thinking (~10%): Moderate usage
- love (~5%): Rare, confusing context (maps "grateful", "warm", "empathetic") 
- sad (~3%): Rare
- surprised (~2%): Very rare
- laugh (0%): Never triggered in the logs

Model drift: The agent frequently tries non-existent emotions like calm, thoughtful, warm, grateful that get alias-mapped. This suggests the 7-emotion palette is too coarse.

